Third-party assets

- Poly Haven glTF props in book/assets/models (WoodenTable_01, vintage_oil_lamp,
  wooden_lantern_01, GothicBed_01, ClassicNightstand_01, painted_wooden_nightstand,
  book_encyclopedia_set_01, side_table_01): CC0-1.0, Powered by Poly Haven.
- Generated page textures, icons, plus the plush bear model and Qwen3-TTS / edge-tts
  narration files are part of this kit for the sample story «Медвежонок Миша и
  упавшая звёздочка».
